# Parameterized type alias basic usage
# [type [let a b] Body] declares a type alias with parameters
# After T-1193, constructors are accessed via qualified dot-notation: Pair.Pair

[
  Pair: [type [let a b] [Pair first: a  second: b]]
  int-str: [Pair.Pair first: 42  second: "hello"]
]
int-str.first
=== error
[E070] circular dependency detected while evaluating thunk (defined at 1:1-1:1) (materialized at 8:1-8:14)

=== warn
[NotARecord] expected record type, got Fn@Pair [first: _t3 second: _t4]
[NotARecord] expected record type, got <error>
